INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: set
argument:: key
code::\dur:: is code::\dur_flex::: an Array becomes an editable link::Classes/RCDurList::, a Function becomes a per-loop pattern, anything else is streamed. Dur edits land at the next event.
argument:: val
nil removes the key (the pattern restarts).
argument:: seed
argument:: quant
code::\default:: → link::#-editQuant::; nil → next event; a number → grid in beats.
